### 카카오 로그인
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/social
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "KAKAO",
  "accessToken": "replace-with-kakao-access-token"
}

### Google 로그인
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/social
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "GOOGLE",
  "identityToken": "replace-with-google-id-token"
}

### Apple 로그인
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/social
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "APPLE",
  "identityToken": "replace-with-apple-identity-token",
  "authorizationCode": "replace-with-apple-authorization-code"
}

### 서비스 토큰 갱신
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/token/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "replace-with-nook-refresh-token"
}

### 로그아웃
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer replace-with-access-token
